   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "seed": 798597659,
   "text": "on_hand    = \u03a3 ledger quantity              physically in the warehouse\non_rent    = \u03a3 rent_out \u2212 \u03a3 rent_return     out with customers\nowned      = on_hand + on_rent              \u2190 VALUATION USES THIS\nreserved   = \u03a3 active reservations          NOT from the ledger\navailable  = on_hand \u2212 reserved             sellable / bookable today\n\nA gown at a wedding is still an asset. v1 made rent_out negative against\nthe same sum that produced stock worth, so total inventory value collapsed\nevery busy weekend and recovered on Monday.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "on_hand    = \u03a3 ledger quantity              physically in the warehouse\non_rent    = \u03a3 rent_out \u2212 \u03a3 rent_return     out with customers\nowned      = on_hand + on_rent              \u2190 VALUATION USES THIS\nreserved   = \u03a3 active reservations          NOT from the ledger\navailable  = on_hand \u2212 reserved             sellable / bookable today\n\nA gown at a wedding is still an asset. v1 made rent_out negative against\nthe same sum that produced stock worth, so total inventory value collapsed\nevery busy weekend and recovered on Monday.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
